                "2. Paste the exact live URL shown by YOMI:" + Environment.NewLine + url + Environment.NewLine +
                "3. Set Width to " + width.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + " and Height to " + height.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "." + Environment.NewLine +
                "4. Press OK. YOMI updates that source automatically while it is running." + Environment.NewLine + Environment.NewLine +
                "YOMI verifies the local Browser Source route automatically. You normally do not need to choose between the legacy overlay paths yourself." + Environment.NewLine + Environment.NewLine +
                "Use multiple Browser Sources only when you want to place YOMI modules separately in OBS.";
